                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/hume#NanoMaterial> ;
                                   rdfs:label "nano object"@en ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Material with any external dimension in the nanoscale, i.e. in the range of 1-100 nm."@en ;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "NanoObject"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/ssbd/NanoParticle
