                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "NanoRod"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/ssbd/NanoStructuredMaterial
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/NanoStructuredMaterial> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/hume#NanoMaterial> ;
                                               rdfs:label "nano structured material"@en ;
